repository-code: "https://github.com/dantengs/dqcp-vst-mixing-data"
abstract: >-
  Spectra, OPE coefficients, extremal-functional matrices and raw inputs for the
  SO(5) mixed vector-singlet-tensor conformal bootstrap at derivative order 23 and
  the SO(5) fuzzy-sphere model up to N=12 orbitals, including primary
  identifications from special conformal generators and conversion factors to a
  common OPE convention.
keywords:
  - conformal bootstrap
  - fuzzy sphere
  - deconfined quantum criticality
  - SO(5)
  - OPE coefficients
